                                                "example_id": "c48a333a-0455-4fe3-9105-422ca3d5a82d",
                                                "sense_id": "847fae45-0000-3e8a-9051-0f019bbcb7cc",
                                                "text": "Most mammifera exhale, in the rutting season, peculiar emanations serving to annouce to the male the presence of the female, and excite in him the sexual desire. This situation is true also in the case of insects, for example, in the female of the bombyx butterfly[.]"
